ity rooftops whith our new game \"Vertigo Beke VR\"! Coming from BlackGanymede , this game will immerse you in an adrenaline fueled ride on various heights. Traverse different maps on your bike, as you collect the checkpoints . Rush through the rooftops of the urban town or make your way through the city in the sky while keeping yourself from falling. Overcome your fear of heights as you go along So what are you waiting for? immerse into Vertigo Bike VR now, and get a hit of that adrenaline!", "short_description": "Take an exciting ride on the city rooftops whith our new game \"Vertigo Beke VR\"! Coming from BlackGanymede , this game will immerse you in an adrenaline fueled ride on various heights. Traverse different maps on your bike, as you collect the checkpoints while overcoming your fear of heights. So what are you waiting for? immerse into Vertigo Bike VR now, and get a hit of that adrenaline!"}]}, "developer_name": "Shaheer Tahir", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://blackganymede.webs.com/privacy-terms", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "http://blackganymede.webs.com/privacy-terms", "publisher_name": "BlackGanymede", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://blackganymede.webs.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": null, "genres": ["ADVENTURE", "EXPLORATION", "PUZZLE", "SIMULATION", "SPORTS"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["GAMEPAD"], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "679983673197836"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162754_169752890281901_8822851398606520320_n.png?s